  "text": "The largest bone in the human body is the femur, also known as the thigh bone.\n\n***\n\nA cavern vast, where knowledge sleeps,\nIn silent halls, the promise keeps.\nA testament to minds that roam,\nTo seek the light, to find the home.\n\nEach spine a door, a world untold,\nA story waiting to unfold.\nAnother life, another view,\nIn every page, a path anew.\n\nThe keeper watches, wise and old,\nWho knows the tales that books have told.\nWith every cover, spine, and page,\nHe guards the wisdom of the age."
